1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,940
Three quick exam habits.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:09,153
The central fringe is always bright, because the path difference there is zero for every wavelength.

3
00:00:09,153 --> 00:00:15,677
The n th dark fringe sits at n minus a half, times beta, not n beta.

4
00:00:15,677 --> 00:00:19,778
And inside a medium, always use lambda over n.

